# Copy to .env and fill in real values. .env itself is gitignored — never commit real tokens.

# Classic GitHub PAT used by tools/gh-agent-board for live/manual smoke testing against a real
# GitHub Projects (v2) board (e.g. specs/copilot-agent-issue-board's T031 smoke test).
#
# Create at: https://github.com/settings/tokens/new
# Required scopes (check ONLY these two top-level boxes, nothing else):
#   - repo     (full control of private repos — classic PATs can't be scoped to a single repo;
#               this also implicitly includes repo:status, repo_deployment, public_repo, repo:invite,
#               security_events as GitHub-bundled sub-scopes, which is expected)
#   - project  (needed for `gh project` commands: item-add, item-edit, field-list, view)
#
# Do not check: admin:org, workflow, admin:repo_hook, write:repo_hook, read:repo_hook, packages,
# notifications, user, discussion, audit_log, network_configurations, gpg_key, ssh_signing_key —
# none of these are needed by this tooling.
#
# Recommended expiration: 7 days or shorter, since this is only used for manual/local smoke testing.
GH_CLASSIC_KEY=
